OL,3,GNEWSADisruption and flood warning as
OL,4,Astorm sweeps in
OL,5,
OL,6,FStorm Austen has continued to cause
OL,7,Fdisruption as it sweeps across Dorset,
OL,8,FHampshire and the Isle of Wight, having
OL,9,Farrived in the south west overnight.
OL,11,FThe Environment Agency (EA) earlier
OL,12,Fissued flood warnings for the Dorset
OL,13,Fcoast, including the Chiswell area and
OL,14,FChristchurch Harbour, with people urged
OL,15,Fto avoid seafronts and harbours due to
OL,16,Fwaves overtopping and spray containing
OL,17,Fdebris.
OL,19,FFive flood warnings in place for Dorset
OL,20,Fwere all removed shortly after 15:00
OL,21,FBST.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
