OL,3,GNEWSADisruption and flood warning as
OL,4,Astorm sweeps in
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere have been power cuts reported and
OL,7,Ffallen trees and downed power lines
OL,8,Fcausing disruption to roads, ferries
OL,9,Fand public transport services.
